WEBVTT

00:00.560 --> 00:04.613
Enough when did I say to withdraw south?

00:05.560 --> 00:08.907
Xuan Kingdom and Wuzhao have no business to do.

00:09.800 --> 00:11.520
Then what does brother-in-law mean?

00:12.040 --> 00:17.227
Your guards will work harder tonight secretly keep a close watch on that Chu Maolun and those two Wuzhao men.

00:17.960 --> 00:22.640
Let them do whatever they want don't stop them but report to me at any time.

00:26.000 --> 00:26.880
Yes.

